   "design": "The installation and test record opens prefilled with machine, device and required tests from the risk assessment and order, and the engineer enters the measured values, not the planned ones. Saving the record adds each device to the maintenance system's asset register with its inspection interval and reminders, so the spreadsheet and manual schedule checks drop. Reading, ordering, installing, testing, instructing and the technical file stay with the engineer. No AI sits in any safety function.",
